<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Tap issue of 6.5 pct five-year bond all sold- NTMA.</title>
<headline>Tap issue of 6.5 pct five-year bond all sold- NTMA.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Tuesday it sold all the 75 million pound tap in its 6.5 percent bond due 2001.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom - +353-1-6613377</p>
